DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nAre you interested in learning how to use 
 a computer? Want to become more confident around your own laptop or librar
 y computers? Join us at the Manning Branch for small group guided lessons 
 with a librarian\, using Chicago DigitalLearn. We will cover computer basi
 cs such as keyboard and mouse\, navigating a desktop\, and accessibility o
 ptions over three sessions. Laptops and computer accessories will be avail
 able. Please call the Manning branch or speak to a librarian to sign up fo
 r the session in-\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/even
 ts/6a5e7194a41369ab2c676513
LOCATION:Manning\, 6 S. Hoyne Ave.\, Chicago\, IL 60612
