DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Children's Museum - Program Calendar\\nCost
 : paid admission (free first Sunday for Chicago residents)\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Music & Dance\\n\\nCreate your own set of trading cards u
 sing paper\, markers\, and other fun materials showing your favorite part 
 of Chicago Children’s Museum! You can trade\, keep\, give\, or take home
  your cards or someone else's! Workshop Times 10:30\, 11:30\, 12:30\, 1:30
 \, 2:30\, 3:30 Space is limited in Art Studio and Tinkering Lab. Free pass
 es are available 1 hour before the workshop starts at each workshop locati
 on.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.chicagochildrensmuseum.org/program-calenda
 r
LOCATION:Chicago Children's Museum\, 700 E Grand Ave\, Chicago\, IL 60611
URL:https://www.chicagochildrensmuseum.org/program-calendar
