DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Field Museum - Events\\nCost: Included with admissi
 on\\nAges: All ages\\nCategory: General\\n\\nCome discover the incredible 
 diversity of amphibians with Conservation Ecologist & Field Museum Curator
  of Amphibians Diego Santana. We'll explore the three major groups of livi
 ng amphibians (with a focus on frogs and toads) to learn about their diver
 sity\, biology\, fascinating adaptations\, and the important roles they pl
 ay in ecosystems around the world.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.fieldmuseum
 .org/our-events/meet-a-scientist/diversity-of-amphibians
